{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"media","input":{"id":35753,"type":"tv"},"checkedAt":1793640282955,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"source":"tmdb-api","id":35753,"type":"tv","sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/35753","fetchedAt":"2026-11-02T17:24:42.955Z","originalLanguage":"ja-JP","title":{"value":"The Familiar of Zero","language":"it-IT"},"originalTitle":"ゼロの使い魔","overview":{"value":"Il nome di Louise Françoise Le Blanc de La Vallière e le sue capacità di incantesimo sono così scarse che tutti all'Accademia di Magia di Tristain la chiamano semplicemente \"Louise lo Zero\". L'umiliazione di Louise aumenta solo durante un importante test del secondo anno, convoca inspiegabilmente Hiraga Saito, un'adolescente del tutto normale di Tokyo. Ora è bloccata con lui e Saito è bloccato con la vita schifosa di essere un familiare.","language":"it-IT"},"startDate":"2006-07-03","endDate":"2012-03-24","status":"Ended","rating":8.4,"ratingCount":631,"numberOfEpisodes":49,"numberOfSeasons":4,"genres":["Animazione","Commedia","Action & Adventure","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"countries":["Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"23m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[{"id":173,"name":"AT-X","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fERjndErEpveJmQZccJbJDi93rj.png"},{"id":663,"name":"Chiba TV","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8XNtModCxAwtvLy86b3phkE1jge.png"}],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":83928,"name":"Rie Kugimiya","role":"Louise Françoise Le Blanc de La Vallière (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xHonhNFpTpz9zCVXLAF7D4OuHLv.jpg"},{"id":224413,"name":"Satoshi Hino","role":"Saito Hiraga (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ZJIiwIVF2zDyyFr7oXewj0eEuu.jpg"},{"id":1253562,"name":"Nanako Inoue","role":"Kirche Augusta Frederica von Anhalt Zerbst (voice)"},{"id":1241607,"name":"Yuka Inokuchi","role":"Tabitha (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rh7COUDzoT1VkaTLWpxbLq33TSN.jpg"},{"id":89903,"name":"Mamiko Noto","role":"Tiffania Westwood (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wCSD7Umgzc66p8VGXrrMZtSLSuS.jpg"},{"id":202806,"name":"Yui Horie","role":"Siesta (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/73yQlMWaiOMrhvPCNyOCbbCkILZ.jpg"},{"id":1248141,"name":"Tetsuo Goto","role":"Derflingher (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f1cdiE34KIKz64NsdbcjC8A785R.jpg"},{"id":9705,"name":"Takahiro Sakurai","role":"Guiche de Grammont (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8s8owcKmpRAuhzEGjSdRpztthUg.jpg"},{"id":215121,"name":"Mikako Takahashi","role":"Montmorency Margarita la Fère de Montmorency (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5Cnw3N4vrr1HSrBYx6DHJiJifc4.jpg"},{"id":151183,"name":"Ayako Kawasumi","role":"Henrietta de Tristain (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vb4cgQUlZdaZT3P4RI27x2PGwpH.jpg"},{"id":81852,"name":"Takeshi Aono","role":"Osmond (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e3IaulH39g31sTIZuiUsXXc5iZj.jpg"},{"id":1242017,"name":"Takuma Suzuki","role":"Colbert (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dLan4nX3jX8pAWiOgfhyJNjFKnr.jpg"},{"id":219563,"name":"Satomi Arai","role":"Verdande / Sylphid (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v95wU1gpSLAOJS5yKFTxyheXAW2.jpg"},{"id":126698,"name":"Kenji Nojima","role":"Bidashal Vitartial","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nRSPVjDkdpnrQabnK5mENH118zN.jpg"},{"id":112277,"name":"Michiko Neya","role":"Agnès Chevalier de Milan (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A1mqjatShQZJSTXFdm4fTkQXv83.jpg"},{"id":1253137,"name":"Chiemi Ishimatsu","role":"Michelle (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qa6sbHHdYuWwpeDw5rImOVne0L6.jpg"},{"id":1096528,"name":"Daisuke Hirakawa","role":"Julio Chesaré (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8uDi5NxFdxFvfVyo4n5CeOSLWEf.jpg"},{"id":115792,"name":"Masako Katsuki","role":"Sheffield (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oIBGCgHbMy0UeFHOASKugyPHGNx.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"The Familiar of Zero","overview":"Il nome di Louise Françoise Le Blanc de La Vallière e le sue capacità di incantesimo sono così scarse che tutti all'Accademia di Magia di Tristain la chiamano semplicemente \"Louise lo Zero\". L'umiliazione di Louise aumenta solo durante un importante test del secondo anno, convoca inspiegabilmente Hiraga Saito, un'adolescente del tutto normale di Tokyo. Ora è bloccata con lui e Saito è bloccato con la vita schifosa di essere un familiare."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Familiar of Zero","overview":"Louise Françoise Le Blanc de La Vallière’s name is so long and her spell-casting skills are so poor that everyone at the Tristain Academy of Magic just calls her “Louise the Zero.” Louise’s humiliation only increases during an important second-year test, she inexplicably summons Saito Hiraga, a totally normal teenager from Tokyo. Now she’s stuck with him and Saito’s stuck with the lousy life of being a familiar."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"平凡な高校生・平賀才人はある日突然、異世界ハルケギニアに召喚されてしまう。彼をこの世界に召喚したのは、トリステイン魔法学院の生徒でありながら魔法の才能がまるで無い「ゼロのルイズ」こと、ルイズ・フランソワーズ・ル・ブラン・ド・ラ・ヴァリエールだった。 失敗とはいえ、召喚の儀式によって呼び出された才人は、「使い魔」としてルイズと契約のキスを交わす。すると、才人の左手には使い魔の証である契約のルーンが浮かび上がった。こうして、ルイズと「犬」扱いされる才人との奇妙な同居生活と冒険が始まった。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lFCXxqDHNpC1fOZPEOrkU3AoHdH.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lFCXxqDHNpC1fOZPEOrkU3AoHdH.png","language":"en","width":790,"height":299},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zsOa0CzgkpzMYHM66KmIE0joK1B.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zsOa0CzgkpzMYHM66KmIE0joK1B.png","language":"en","width":699,"height":298},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5FkWGtbfMul2FyOMWfHdimvP21P.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5FkWGtbfMul2